+ *   for an element whose document has no view.
+ * @remarks
+ * The preference is read at each call, so a change to it applies from the next call on. A carousel
+ * reads it before it arms its timer, because the automatic cycle is the motion the preference asks
+ * to stop, while a slide a call, a key, or a swipe asks for still runs.
